Bundled dependency notices
==========================

The browser bundle also includes debug, ms, events, sdp-transform, and the
process browser shim. Preserve the following MIT notices with redistributed
copies of the bundle, together with the JsSIP notice above.

The embedded JsSIP 3.10.1 package metadata specifies debug ^4.3.1,
events ^3.3.0, and sdp-transform ^2.14.1. The bundle also contains ms and
process. This checkout has no build lockfile identifying the exact resolved
dependency versions. Versions in the source URLs below identify the upstream
license copies used for these notices, not verified installed versions.

